  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice zucchini into rounds.\n• Thinly slice capsicum.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over savoury seasoning, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until just tender, 15 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83b034264524ca978d85d/step-231f3200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice garlic.\n• Pick thyme leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83b034264524ca978d85d/step-e2835d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once veggies are done, stack 5 sheets of filo pastry with a drizzle of olive oil between each layer and place on a second lined oven tray.\n• Evenly spoon tomato sugo in the centre of the pastry, leaving a 4cm border around the edge.\n• Evenly arrange cooked veggies and snacking tomatoes on top of sugo. Sprinkle with thyme and garlic and drizzle with olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83b034264524ca978d85d/step-ed19bb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving the centre exposed.\n• Bake galette, until golden, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83b034264524ca978d85d/step-85854b30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine rocket leaves, a drizzle of marinated goat cheese oil and balsamic vinegar. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83b034264524ca978d85d/step-8d238340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice galette.\n• Carefully divide ratatouille-style galette between plates and top with rocket.\n• Crumble over goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83b034264524ca978d85d/step-a2ddbf50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
